quran[5]{c,v,t}:
  2,1,"Alif, Lam, Mim."
  2,2,"This is the (Glorious) Book. There is no doubt about it. It is a guide for those who are God-conscious,"
  2,3,"who believe in the Unseen, establish prayer and spend from what we have provided them,"
  2,4,"and who believe in what has been revealed to you (O Prophet) and what was revealed before you, and have sure faith in the Hereafter."
  2,5,"They are the ones upon guidance from their Lord, and they are the ones who shall be successful."
